Bind read-only storage buffers passed as native handles (BindGroupDesc::storageBuffers).

- include/rive/renderer/ore/ore_types.hpp: Ore BindGroupDesc: add read-only storage buffer entries, passed as native handles since YUP creates storage buffers outside ore (GpuRenderPass::setStorageBuffer)
- source/renderer/ore/ore_bind_group_layout.cpp: Ore validateBindGroupDesc: count read-only storage buffer layout entries against BindGroupDesc::storageBuffers, not the UBO entries
- source/renderer/ore/metal/ore_bind_group_metal.hpp: Ore Metal bind group: declare the read-only storage buffer binding (native MTLBuffer, offset and WGSL binding, resolved through the bound pipeline)
- source/renderer/ore/metal/ore_bind_group_metal.hpp: Ore Metal bind group: hold the read-only storage buffer bindings
- source/renderer/ore/metal/ore_context_metal.mm: Ore Metal makeBindGroup: record each read-only storage buffer entry, whose native handle is an id<MTLBuffer>
- source/renderer/ore/metal/ore_render_pass_metal.mm: Ore Metal applyBindGroup: bind each read-only storage buffer to the vertex and fragment stages the bound pipeline reads it from
- source/renderer/ore/d3d11/ore_context_d3d11.cpp: Ore D3D11 makeBindGroup: record read-only storage buffer SRVs (BindGroupDesc::storageBuffers) with their WGSL binding, resolved to t registers through the bound pipeline
- source/renderer/ore/d3d11/ore_bind_group_d3d11.hpp: Ore D3D11 bind group: hold the read-only storage buffer SRVs
- source/renderer/ore/d3d11/ore_render_pass_d3d11.cpp: Ore D3D11 applyBindGroup: bind read-only storage buffer SRVs with VSSetShaderResources / PSSetShaderResources at the bound pipeline's slots
- source/renderer/ore/vulkan/ore_context_vulkan.cpp: Ore Vulkan makeBindGroup: record a storage buffer write for each read-only storage entry, whose native handle points to a VkBuffer
- source/renderer/ore/vulkan/ore_bind_group_vulkan.hpp: Ore Vulkan BindGroupVulkan: keep the storage buffer writes in the replayable write recipe
- source/renderer/ore/vulkan/ore_bind_group_vulkan.cpp: Ore Vulkan resolveDescriptorSet: size the descriptor writes for the storage buffer writes too
- source/renderer/ore/vulkan/ore_bind_group_vulkan.cpp: Ore Vulkan resolveDescriptorSet: write the read-only storage buffers into every set
- source/renderer/ore/wgpu/ore_context_wgpu.cpp: Ore WebGPU makeBindGroup: record read-only storage buffers passed as native WGPUBuffer handles
- source/renderer/ore/wgpu/ore_bind_group_wgpu.hpp: Ore WebGPU BindGroupWGPU: storage buffer entries for the bind group recipe
- source/renderer/ore/wgpu/ore_bind_group_wgpu.cpp: Ore WebGPU resolveBindGroup: reserve room for the storage buffer entries
- source/renderer/ore/wgpu/ore_bind_group_wgpu.cpp: Ore WebGPU resolveBindGroup: add the read-only storage buffer entries
- source/renderer/ore/gl/ore_bind_group_gl.hpp: Ore GL bind group: storage buffer bindings (native GL buffer name, range, WGSL binding)
- source/renderer/ore/gl/ore_bind_group_gl.hpp: Ore GL bind group: storage buffer binding list
- source/renderer/ore/gl/ore_context_gl.cpp: Ore GL makeBindGroup: record storage buffer entries, whose binding point resolves through the bound pipeline
- source/renderer/ore/gl/ore_render_pass_gl.cpp: Ore GL applyBindGroup: bind storage buffer ranges at the bound pipeline's binding points

